WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
<v Alex M H Smith>My guest today is April Dunford, and we are going to talk about positioning.

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:13.200
<v Alex M H Smith>Which is a word that has been worn almost smooth by overuse.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:22.100
<v April Dunford>It has, and I think that is because most people treat it as a messaging exercise.

4
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:31.900
April Dunford: Positioning is not what you say. It is the context you set before you say anything at all.

5
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:10.000
<v Alex M H Smith>So the failure mode is a company that has a good story and the wrong frame.
